id=tab_dp_watchdog
name=Tab S7 DP Link Watchdog
version=v1.1.0
versionCode=11000
author=WorkBuddy
description=Watch DP Alt Mode link over USB-C. If the external touchscreen (USB 04f3:8512) is online while extcon reports DP=0 (e.g. after reboot or power-applied-after-cable), perform a virtual replug (port_type sink->dual) to force full CC/PD/VDM renegotiation and restore the display automatically.
